{'symbol': 'GILD', 'date': '2023-02-01 08:35:00', 'title': 'GILEAD AWARDS $7.6 MILLION IN GRANTS TO ADVANCE HEALTH EQUITY IN BREAST CANCER', 'text': 'FOSTER CITY, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--GILEAD SCIENCES, INC. (NASDAQ: GILD) AWARDED $7.6 MILLION IN GRANT FUNDING TO 24 U.S.-BASED, COMMUNITY ORGANIZATIONS THROUGH THE NEWLY CREATED TOWARD HEALTH EQUITY (THE) ONCOLOGY GRANT™. THE FUNDING WILL SUPPORT EVIDENCE-BASED INTERVENTIONS THAT ADDRESS BARRIERS TO CARE AND SOCIAL DETERMINANTS OF HEALTH INCLUDING PATIENT NAVIGATOR TRAINING, CULTURAL COMPETENCY TRAINING, AND SERVICES COMBATING BARRIERS SUCH AS TRANSPORTATION.'}